                    indicating good discriminative                              
                    performance for malignant vs benign                         
                    lesion classification.                                      
                    Validation Metric: 0.9037                                   
                                                                                
                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We can improve generalization                       
                    and boost AUROC by incorporating Mixup                      
                    data augmentation during training,                          
                    which blends pairs of images and their                      
                    labels to regularize the model. We'll                       
                    implement Mixup in the training loop                        
                    with an alpha of 0.4, modifying                             
                    `train_one_epoch` to mix inputs and                         
                    targets and compute a weighted loss.                        
                    The rest of the pipeline (data loading,                     
                    model, optimizer) remains unchanged.                        
                    This atomic change should help the                          
