                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: Here we switch to a smaller                         
                    128×128 input size and only 3 training                      
                    epochs to avoid the timeout, and we                         
                    integrate PyTorch’s mixed‐precision                         
                    `torch.cuda.amp` when a CUDA device is                      
                    available to speed up training. The                         
                    `train_one_epoch` loop now uses                             
                    `autocast` and `GradScaler` on GPU, and                     
                    we include a well‐documented                                
