                    Design: I will integrate a OneCycleLR                       
                    learning rate scheduler to help the                         
                    model converge to a better minimum by                       
                    cyclically varying the LR between a low                     
                    start and a higher peak during                              
                    training. This requires only adding the                     
                    scheduler after optimizer creation and                      
                    calling `scheduler.step()` each batch                       
                    in the training loop. The rest of the                       
